      "content": "Hey, I'm an admin at a law firm and we're looking to move away from SMS-based 2FA because of the interception risks. Can you give me a step-by-step guide on how to implement hardware security keys (like YubiKeys) for our staff instead? Need to know the deployment process and how to handle onboarding for non-technical users.",
