    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, thanks. what about the security side of it? specifically, we've been hearing a lot about \"threat actors\" and how they target weak links in the chain. how much does moving to hardware keys actually mitigate the risk of someone bypassing our systems compared to the old SMS method?",
